<title>CANADA: MOTOR RACING-RESULTS AT TORONTO CART RACE.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-RESULTS AT TORONTO CART RACE.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results at the Toronto CART auto race on Sunday (95 laps of 1.721-mile (2.77 km) circuit):</p>
<p>1. Mark Blundell (Britain), Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 92.779 mph (149.374 kph).</p>
<p>2. Alessandro Zanardi (Italy), Reynard Honda</p>
<p>3. Andre Ribeiro (Brazil), Reynard Honda</p>
<p>4. Michael Andretti (U.S.), Swift Ford</p>
<p>5. Scott Pruett (U.S.), Reynard Ford</p>
<p>6. Mauricio Gugelmin (Brazil), Reynard Mercedes-Benz</p>
<p>7. Jimmy Vasser (U.S.), Reynard Honda</p>
<p>8. Raul Boesel (Brazil), Reynard Ford</p>
<p>9. Bobby Rahal (U.S.), Reynard Ford</p>
<p>10. Paul Tracy (Canada), Penske Mercedes-Benz</p>
</text>
